### Login (Establish Session)
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{TEST_USERNAME}}",
    "password": "{{TEST_USER_PASSWORD}}"
}

###

### List Employee Compensation
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation
Content-Type: application/json
###

### Create Employee Compensation
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "baseSalary": 75000,
    "hourlyRate": 36.5,
    "overtimeRate": 1.5,
    "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
    "endDate": "2024-12-31",
    "currency": "USD",
    "paymentFrequency": "monthly",
    "changeReason": "Annual salary review"
}

###

### Update Employee Compensation
PUT {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation/1
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "baseSalary": 78000,
    "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
    "changeReason": "Mid-year adjustment"
}

###

### Delete Employee Compensation
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation/1
Content-Type: application/json
 
###

### Calculate Total Compensation for Date
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation/calculate/2024-06-15
Content-Type: application/json
 
###

### Get Compensation History
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/compensation/history
Content-Type: application/json
 
###

### List Employee Deductions
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/deductions
Content-Type: application/json
 
###

### Create Employee Deduction
POST {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/deductions
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
    "name": "Health Insurance",
    "type": "fixed",
    "amount": 250.00,
    "frequency": "monthly",
    "effectiveDate": "2024-01-01",
    "endDate": "2024-12-31",
    "description": "Company-sponsored health insurance premium"
}

###

### Update Employee Deduction
PUT {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/deductions/1
Content-Type: application/json
 
{
    "amount": 275.00,
    "description": "Updated premium amount"
}

###

### Delete Employee Deduction
DELETE {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/deductions/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{AUTH_TOKEN}}

###

### Calculate Total Deductions for Date
GET {{API_BASE_URL}}/v1/hris/employees/1/deductions/calculate/2024-06-15
Content-Type: application/json
 